      "reviewedMechanism": "For each declared alias, compare exact relative path and Git-bound link text, reject duplicates/cycles/external lexical resolution, require a physical symlink, and compare its strict actual final directory against the statically resolved declared internal endpoint in both roots. The existing verifier invocation runs before and after commands. Existing forest text aliases use a separate byte-authenticated path and are not blanket-rejected.",
